    "name": "Cave Trek",
    "steam_appid": 3686810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/cbc2132530b937dbe30fcfa123127e4e.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/cbc2132530b937dbe30fcfa123127e4e.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/cbc2132530b937dbe30fcfa123127e4e.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cSpelunky But With Tool System!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/c594063ed12e3a9b7d05400d88531855.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/c594063ed12e3a9b7d05400d88531855.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/c594063ed12e3a9b7d05400d88531855.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Trek is a unique platformer with randomized levels that offer a challenging new experience each time you play. Journey deep underground and explore fantastic places filled with all manner of monsters, traps, and treasure. You'll have complete freedom while you navigate the fully-destructible environments and master their many secrets. To stay or flee, to kill or rescue, to shop or steal... in Cave Trek, the choice is yours and so are the consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/b6f9c90fd4e5160ea6c41613e7618f45.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/b6f9c90fd4e5160ea6c41613e7618f45.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/b6f9c90fd4e5160ea6c41613e7618f45.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Roguelike&quot; Platforming</strong>\u00a0- Randomly-generated, fully-destructible levels are dense with danger. Quick thinking and a deep understanding will keep you alive along the knife's edge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/dc2f208b99f4ad0428a01809bb4c05c6.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/dc2f208b99f4ad0428a01809bb4c05c6.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/dc2f208b99f4ad0428a01809bb4c05c6.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool System </strong>- You can use the tools in your hand or those you obtain to build or destroy terrain, allowing battles to have more tactical options to choose from.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/35f78b2bd56c04814f7f55a7316ab238.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/35f78b2bd56c04814f7f55a7316ab238.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/35f78b2bd56c04814f7f55a7316ab238.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboard</strong> - You can find your place among players all over the world and keep breaking your own highest records over and over again</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/cbc2132530b937dbe30fcfa123127e4e.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/cbc2132530b937dbe30fcfa123127e4e.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/cbc2132530b937dbe30fcfa123127e4e.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cSpelunky But With Tool System!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/c594063ed12e3a9b7d05400d88531855.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/c594063ed12e3a9b7d05400d88531855.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/c594063ed12e3a9b7d05400d88531855.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Trek is a unique platformer with randomized levels that offer a challenging new experience each time you play. Journey deep underground and explore fantastic places filled with all manner of monsters, traps, and treasure. You'll have complete freedom while you navigate the fully-destructible environments and master their many secrets. To stay or flee, to kill or rescue, to shop or steal... in Cave Trek, the choice is yours and so are the consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/b6f9c90fd4e5160ea6c41613e7618f45.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/b6f9c90fd4e5160ea6c41613e7618f45.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/b6f9c90fd4e5160ea6c41613e7618f45.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Roguelike&quot; Platforming</strong>\u00a0- Randomly-generated, fully-destructible levels are dense with danger. Quick thinking and a deep understanding will keep you alive along the knife's edge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/dc2f208b99f4ad0428a01809bb4c05c6.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/dc2f208b99f4ad0428a01809bb4c05c6.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/dc2f208b99f4ad0428a01809bb4c05c6.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool System </strong>- You can use the tools in your hand or those you obtain to build or destroy terrain, allowing battles to have more tactical options to choose from.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/35f78b2bd56c04814f7f55a7316ab238.poster.avif?t=1747877859\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/35f78b2bd56c04814f7f55a7316ab238.webm?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686810/extras/35f78b2bd56c04814f7f55a7316ab238.mp4?t=1747877859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboard</strong> - You can find your place among players all over the world and keep breaking your own highest records over and over again</p></li></ul>",
